{"2780140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sauna of the DEAD", "steam_appid": 2780140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sauna of the DEAD</strong> is an action RPG where you become a heatwave master in Japanese-style sauna, swinging your towel to blast hot air at zombies and demons in the underworld's saunas to defeat them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-style pixel art!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The saunas of the underworld are, surprisingly, Japanese-style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780140/extras/1bc682ccc6338cd7ce7b9c62a53ce98c.poster.avif?t=1759506376\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780140/extras/1bc682ccc6338cd7ce7b9c62a53ce98c.webm?t=1759506376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780140/extras/1bc682ccc6338cd7ce7b9c62a53ce98c.mp4?t=1759506376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Note: Settings for playing on STEAM DECK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing on a STEAM DECK, please follow these steps:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Properties &gt; Compatibility &gt; Force the use of a specific Steam Play compatibility tool &gt; Select &quot;Proton Experimental&quot;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a heatwave master, you were lured by a suspicious man to work in the underworld's saunas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over a 7-day stay in the underworld, defeat many zombies and demons to aim for a showdown with the Demon King Vihta.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780140/extras/c67f99109e511bb935fcf01cfaeba23e.avif?t=1759506376\" width=300 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Swing your towel to hurl hot air at zombies and demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use different towel swinging techniques to defeat many zombies and demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Collect Totonoi orbs to power up through Sauna &gt; Cold Bath &gt; Lounging Rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Receive rewards based on the number of defeats, and power up with sauna goods and drinks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780140/extras/93698c7e06104cfe7657bd0367afd87b.avif?t=1759506376\" width=300 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 to 10 hours  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endgame Content</strong><br>By exploring <strong>Sauna Fairytale</strong> or aiming for a high rank in <strong>Endless Summer</strong>, you can enjoy even more gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 <strong>Saunas: 3 Facilities</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zombie Hot Spring</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spa Love</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Great Hell Sauna</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💀 <strong>Survival Sauna: 1 Facility</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sauna Endless Summer</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ <strong>Exploration Sauna: 1 Facility</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sauna Fairytale</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780140/extras/17df9f3c5de6d3bfc70e2aea7f3cc25e.avif?t=1759506376\" width=300 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sauna terminology</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Aufguss involves swinging a towel in the sauna to generate hot air and directing that hot air towards the sauna's patrons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Loyly refers to the act of pouring water on hot stones in the sauna to create steam and increase the sauna's temperature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- In this game, &quot;to be put in order&quot; means to achieve a state of mindfulness and emptiness by repeatedly going through the cycle of Sauna &gt; Cold Bath &gt; Rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780140/extras/680547955a1595fa889e5a460dfc696a.avif?t=1759506376\" width=300 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Video Streaming Guidelines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming is permitted for both individuals and corporations without the need for permission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization is only allowed using the functions provided by the video streaming sites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We appreciate including the game's name in the title of the video or stream and linking to the Steam page in the description.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We take no responsibility for any damages incurred by streaming this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The contents of these guidelines are subject to change without notice.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sauna of the DEAD</strong> is an action RPG where you become a heatwave master in Japanese-style sauna, swinging your towel to blast hot air at zombies and demons in the underworld's saunas to defeat them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-style pixel art!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The saunas of the underworld are, surprisingly, Japanese-style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780140/extras/1bc682ccc6338cd7ce7b9c62a53ce98c.poster.avif?t=1759506376\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780140/extras/1bc682ccc6338cd7ce7b9c62a53ce98c.webm?t=1759506376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780140/extras/1bc682ccc6338cd7ce7b9c62a53ce98c.mp4?t=1759506376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Note: Settings for playing on STEAM DECK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing on a STEAM DECK, please follow these steps:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Properties &gt; Compatibility &gt; Force the use of a specific Steam Play compatibility tool &gt; Select &quot;Proton Experimental&quot;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a heatwave master, you were lured by a suspicious man to work in the underworld's saunas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over a 7-day stay in the underworld, defeat many zombies and demons to aim for a showdown with the Demon King Vihta.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780140/extras/c67f99109e511bb935fcf01cfaeba23e.avif?t=1759506376\" width=300 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Swing your towel to hurl hot air at zombies and demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use different towel swinging techniques to defeat many zombies and demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Collect Totonoi orbs to power up through Sauna &gt; Cold Bath &gt; Lounging Rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Receive rewards based on the number of defeats, and power up with sauna goods and drinks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780140/extras/93698c7e06104cfe7657bd0367afd87b.avif?t=1759506376\" width=300 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 to 10 hours  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endgame Content</strong><br>By exploring <strong>Sauna Fairytale</strong> or aiming for a high rank in <strong>Endless Summer</strong>, you can enjoy even more gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 <strong>Saunas: 3 Facilities</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zombie Hot Spring</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spa Love</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Great Hell Sauna</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💀 <strong>Survival Sauna: 1 Facility</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sauna Endless Summer</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ <strong>Exploration Sauna: 1 Facility</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sauna Fairytale</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780140/extras/17df9f3c5de6d3bfc70e2aea7f3cc25e.avif?t=1759506376\" width=300 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sauna terminology</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Aufguss involves swinging a towel in the sauna to generate hot air and directing that hot air towards the sauna's patrons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Loyly refers to the act of pouring water on hot stones in the sauna to create steam and increase the sauna's temperature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- In this game, &quot;to be put in order&quot; means to achieve a state of mindfulness and emptiness by repeatedly going through the cycle of Sauna &gt; Cold Bath &gt; Rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780140/extras/680547955a1595fa889e5a460dfc696a.avif?t=1759506376\" width=300 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Video Streaming Guidelines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming is permitted for both individuals and corporations without the need for permission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization is only allowed using the functions provided by the video streaming sites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We appreciate including the game's name in the title of the video or stream and linking to the Steam page in the description.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We take no responsibility for any damages incurred by streaming this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The contents of these guidelines are subject to change without notice.</p>", "short_description": "Heatwave Master, bring order to underworld's sauna. FEEL the exhilarating chaos of Heatwave Mastery!", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780140/954f4b58adb87988b0b4370cca8b97501c665ded/header.jpg?t=1759506376", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780140/736cb00befcbe88fc8447b6c006b541f703af7dd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759506376", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780140/736cb00befcbe88fc8447b6c006b541f703af7dd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759506376", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and op